  m_text: "There's a shadow following me, i don't know\nfor how long, but it always
    seems to \ndisappear when i take notice of it, and it's \nimage becomes blurred
    in my mind, like it was \npart of a nightmare i just woke up from.\n\nHas it
    been days, weeks, years? \nIt feels like an eternity down here."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7063b217c11b39f4a8e1a0bb858ebb48, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -1151799480745740044, guid: 7063b217c11b39f4a8e1a0bb858ebb48, type: 2}
